<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">Ruth</book>
  <para style="h">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="mt">Ruth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laitloek rhoek lai a tloek tue vaengah khohmuen ah khokha pai. Te dongah Judah Bethlehem lamkah hlang pakhat tah Moab kho ah bakuep ham a yuu neh a ca rhoi te a caeh puei .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te hlang kah a ming tah Elimelekh tih a yuu ming tah Naomi, a ca rhoi ming tah Mahlon neh Kilion a ming nah. Amih rhoek tah Judah Bethlehem kah Ephraim lamloh Moab khohmuen la cet tih om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te vaengah Noami tah a va Elimelekh te duek tih anih neh a ca rhoi la cul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ca rhoi loh Moab nu a ming ah Orpah neh Ruth te a loh rhoi tih kum rha tluk om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tedae Mahlon neh Kilion khaw bok a duek bal dongah a va, a ca om kolla huta amah buengla cul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tedae BOEIPA loh a pilnam te buh paek ham a hip coeng tila Moab kho ah a yaak. Te dongah hlah uh tih a langa rhoi neh Moab kho lamloh bal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te dongah a om nah hmuen lamloh nong tih a langa rhoi neh amah neh Judah kho long la bal ham cet uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tedae a langa rhoi taengah Naomi loh , “Cet rhoi lamtah na manu im la mael rhoi laeh. Aka duek rhoek neh kai taengah na saii vanbangla sitlohnah te nangmih rhoi taengah BOEIPA loh han saii khaw han saii khaming.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />BOEIPA loh nangmih rhoi te m'pae saeh lamtah na va im kah duemnah khaw hmu rhoi van,” a ti nah tih amih rhoi te a mok hatah a ol a huel uh tih rhap uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te phoeiah anih te, “Namah neh na pilnam taengla bal uh sih,” a ti na rhoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tedae Naomi loh , “Ka canu rhoi aw mael rhoi laeh. Kai taengla balae nan loh rhoi eh ? Nangmih rhoi kah na va la aka poeh ham khaw ka ko khuiah camoe ka khueh pueng tih nim ?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka canu rhoi mael rhoi lamtah cet rhoi laeh, ka patong coeng he, va khueh ham khaw kai hamla ngaiuepnah om ka ti koinih hlaempang pakhat ah ka va taengla ka om vetih ca kan sak sue,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te te a rhoeng duela na lamso rhoi aya ? Hlang la aka poeh pawt te na oei rhoi aya ? Ka ca rhoi aw te moenih ta. BOEIPA kut loh kai n'nan coeng dongah kai tah nangmih rhoi lakah ka phaep uh phat coeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ol a huel tih koep a rhah uh phoeiah tah Orpah loh a mani te a mok. Tedae Ruth long tah khak a lingven.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te vaengah, “Na maya tah a pilnam taeng neh a pathen taengla bal ke! na maya neh bal laeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tedae Ruth loh , “Nang hnoo ham neh nang hnuk lamkah bal ham tah kai he nan doo pawt mako, na pongpa nah ah ka pongpa vetih na rhaehba nah ah ka rhaehba ni, na pilnam khaw ka pilnam van, na Pathen khaw ka Pathen ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na duek nah ah ka duek saeh lamtah pahoi ng'up uh van saeh. BOEIPA loh kai taengah han saii saeh lamtah hang khoep nawn saeh. Kai laklo neh nang laklo ah duek long mah n'tuiphih nawn saeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A taengah caeh ham a ning mangkhak te a hmuh vaengah voek ham khaw a toeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te dongah amih rhoi te Bethlehem a pha duela cet rhoi. Bethlehem a pha rhoi van neh amih rhoi kongah khopuei boeih te pangngawl tih, “Noami a te ?,” a ti uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tedae amih taengah tah, “Kai he Naomi la ng'khue uh boeh, Tlungthang loh kai mat m'phaep coeng dongah kai he Mara la ng'khue uh mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai he khangrhueng la ka cet van dae BOEIPA loh kuttling la kai m'bal sak. Balae tih kai te Naomi la nang khue uh. BOEIPA loh kai n'doo tih Tlungthang loh kai soah thae a huet coeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Naomi a bal vaengah Moab kho lamkah anih neh aka mael hmaih a langa Moab Ruth neh cangtun cangah cuek vaengah Bethlehem a pha rhoi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te vaengah Naomi aka ming la a va kah pacaboeina, a ming ah Boaz tah Elimelekh cako khuiah tatthai, hlangrhalh hlang la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab nu Ruth loh Noami taengah, “Lohma la ka cet mai vetih a mikhmuh ah mikdaithen ka dang atah a hnukah cangmo ka yoep van eh,” a ti nah. Te dongah, “Ka canu, cet saw ne,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te dongah cet tih lohma la a pawk vaengah cang at rhoek hnukah a yoep van. Te vaengah Elimelekh kah a hui a ko Boaz lo kah khamyai te Ruth kah a hma la ana pawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te vaengah Boaz te Bethlehem lamloh pakcak ha pawk tih cang aka at rhoek te, “Nangmih taengah BOEIPA om saeh,” a ti nah hatah anih te, “Nang khaw BOEIPA loh yoethen m'pae saeh,” a ti nauh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te phoeiah cang aka at rhoek khuikah amah lopai cadong te Boaz loh , “Hekah hula he unim ca?,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah cang at rhoek aka pai thil cadong loh a doo tih, “Anih tah Moab kho lamkah Naomi neh aka bal Moab nu hula,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te dongah, “Ka yoep van saeh lamtah cang at rhoek hnukkah canghmoek ke ka coi mai eh,” a ti nah. Te phoeiah cet tih pohlip ah rhaih a duem nen te mincang lamloh tahae duela a pai thil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te dongah Ruth te Boaz loh , “Ka canu na yaak moenih a? Cangmo yoep ham te lo lang ah cet boeh, he lamkah khaw nong boeh, kai kah hula rhoek taengah pahoi balak van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lohma li kah cang at rhoek te na mik neh so lamtah amih hnuk ah cet van. Nang te ben pawt ham cadong rhoek te ka uen moenih a? Tui na hal vaengah khaw am ke paan lamtah cadong rhoek kah a than tangtae te o,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te vaengah Ruth te a hmai la buluk tih diklai la bakop. Te phoeiah Boaz te, “Kai he kholong hlang dae kai nan hmat ham khaw balae tih na mikhmuh ah mikdaithen ka dang,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tedae Boaz loh a doo tih, “Na va a dueknah hnukah na mani hamla na saii khaw, na nu na pa, na pacaboeina kah a khohmuen na hnoo tih hlaem hlavai kah na ming pawh pilnam taengla na pawk te a pum la kai taengah a thui rhoela a thui coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na bisai te BOEIPA loh han thuung saeh lamtah a phae hlip ah ying hamla na paan Israel Pathen BOEIPA taeng lamkah na thapang te rhuemtuet la ha om saeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruth loh, “Kai nan hloep dongah ka boeipa nang kah mikhmuh ah mikdaithen ka dang, na sal a lungbuei te cawt na doo coeng tih kai tah na sal bangla ka om moenih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buh caak tue vaengah tah Boaz loh , “Hela ha thoeih lamtah buh te ca dae, na buhkam te a thuui dongah khaw nuem dae,” a ti nah. Te daengah cang at rhoek taeng ah ngol thuk. Te vaengah anih ham vairhum a phom pah tih a hah la a caak phoeiah a caknoi pueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cangmo yoep la koep a thoh hang vaengah, Boaz loh a cadong rhoek te a uen tih, “Canghmoek laklo ah yoep mai cakhaw a hmaithae sak uh boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cangphung dongkah te buem buem uh lamtah anih ham hnoo pauh. A yoep vaengah khaw anih te tluung uh boeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te dongah lohma li ah cangmo te kholaeh due a yoep tih a yoep te a boh vaengah cangtun cangnoek pakhat tluk a om pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te te a khuen tih khopuei a paan. A mani a hmuh vaengah cangmo a yoep a khuen tih a hah phoeikah a caknoi pah te a mani a paek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te vaengah anih te a mani loh , “Tihnin ah melam na yoep tih me rhoek ah lae na saii ? Nang aka hmat tah a yoethen pai saeh,” a ti nah. Te dongah a taengah bi a saii pah hlang te a mani taengah a thui tih, “Tihnin ah a taengah bi ka saii pah hlang kah a ming tah Boaz ni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naomi loh a langa te, “BOEIPA loh anih yoe a then sak. Amah long tah aka hing rhoek taeng neh aka duek rhoek taengah khaw a sitlohnah pat sak pawh a ti nah. Te phoeiah Ruth taengah Naomi loh , “Anih te mamih aka tlan, mah neh aka yoei uh hlang ni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Moab nu Ruth loh , “Kai taengah khaw, 'Kamah taengkah cangah boeih a bawt duela kamah kah cadong rhoek taengah balak mai,’ a ti pataeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te dongah a langa Ruth taengah Naomi loh , “Nang te lo lang ah n'cuuk sak uh voel pawt vetih anih lopai rhoek taengla na pawk te ka canu aw then mai coeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te dongah cangtun cangah neh cangtang cangah a boeih duela cangmo yoep ham Boaz kah lopai rhoek taengah balak tih a mani taengah kho a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ruth te a mani Naomi loh , “Ka canu aw, nang ham ngolbuel khaw ka tlap mapawt a? te ni nang ham a voelphoeng eh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lopai na balak puei Boaz te mah kah huiko moenih a? Anih te khoyin ah cangtilhmuen kah cangtun a cop lah ko te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te dongah sil uh lamtah situi hluk. Te phoeiah na himbai te na pum dongah bai lamtah cangtilhmuen la suntla thuk. A caak a ok a coeng duela hlang taengah moe boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tedae a yalh tue om bitni. Te vaengah a yalh nah hmuen te phatuem lamtah pahoi paan. Te phoeiah a kho te khawn pah lamtah yalh pah. Te vaengah na saii ham te amah loh nang taengah a thui bitni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te dongah amani te, “Kai taengah na thui boeih te saii bitni,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te dongah cangtilhmuen la suntla tih a mani loh anih a uen bangla boeih a saii.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Boaz khaw a caak a ok tih a lungbuei a voelphoeng nen tah yalh hamla canghlom hmatoeng te a paan. Te vaengah a muel la a paan tih a kho a khawn pah phoeiah a yalh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khoyin boengli ah tah tongpa te lakueng tih a hoi uh hatah a kho taengah huta tarha ana yalh pah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te dongah, “Nang ulae?” a ti nah hatah, “Na salnu kai, Ruth ni, nan tlan coeng dongah na salnu he na himbai hmoi neh aka ng'khuk thil laeh,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah, “Ka canu, BOEIPA dongah na yoethen coeng. Hlanglen mai khaw, tattloel mai cakhaw tongpang hnukah na caeh pawt dongah lamhma kah lakah a hnuk lam ni na sitlohnah neh na voelphoeng pueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te dongah ka canu na hoe boeih te rhih boeh, nang tah tatthai nu tila ka pilnam kah vongka tom m'ming coeng dongah nang ham kan saii bitni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai loh kan tlan ham khaw tueng ngawn coeng dae aka tlan ham te kai lakah aka yoei rhep om pueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khoyin ah rhaeh lamtah mincang ah ni nang aka tlan te a om atah a then la n'tlan saeh. Tedae nang te tlan ham a ngaih pawt atah BOEIPA kah hingnah dongah nang te kamah loh kan tlan bitni, mincang duela yalh mai dae,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te dongah mincang duela a kho tang, a kho tang ah a yalh pah. Tedae a hui te kah hlang a hmat hlan ah vawl thoo coeng. Te vaengah Boaz longtah, “Cangtilhmuen huta ha pawk he a ming uh moenih,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te vaengah, “Na pum dongkah te himbai hang khuen lamtah duen lah,” a ti nah. Te dongah himbai te a tuuk doela cangtun khoi rhuk a loeng pah phoeiah Ruth a phueih sak tih kho khuila cet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mani taengla a pawk vaengah, “Ka canu nang u taengah lae na caeh,” a ti nah hatah Hlang loh anih ham a saii pah te boeih a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te dongah, “Cangtun khoi rhuk he kai ham ham poep tih, 'Na mani te kuttling la paan boeh,’ a ti,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te vaengah, “Ka canu tihnin kah olka he a khah uh hlan atah hlang te mong mahpawh, metlamlae olka a dip eh tite na ming duela ngol,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Boaz te vongka la cet tih ngol. Te vaengah aka tlan koi la a thui hlang te ha pawk tih Boaz loh , “Tongmang hela pah lamtah ngol dae lah,” a ti nah. Te dongah phael tih ngol thuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Te phoeiah khopuei kah a hamca rhoek te hlang parha a loh tih, “Hela ngol uh dae,” a ti nah vanbangla amih khaw ngol uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te vaengah aka tlan koi taengah, “Mamih kah manuca Elimelekh khohmuen kah lo aka yoi Noami tah Moab kho lamkah ha bal coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te dongah kai long tah namah hna ah kan yaak sak dae eh ka ti vanbangla hekah aka ngol rhoek hmai neh ka pilnam khuikah a hamca rhoek hmaiah koep lai laeh ka ti. Na tlan ham atah tlan laeh. Tedae na tlan pawt oeh atah kamah taengah he thui. Te daengah ni nang phoeiah aka tlan ham hlang a om pawt te ka ming khaw ka ming van eh. Tedae kai tah nang hnukkah pueng ni,” a ti nah vaengah, “Kamah loh ka tlan ni,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te vaengah Boaz loh , “Naomi neh aka duek kah a yuu Moab nu Ruth kut lamkah khohmuen na lai khohnin vaengah aka duek ming te thoh pah ham ni a rho khaw na lai eh?,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tedae aka tlan loh , “Kamah loh ka tlan ham akhaw a tlan ham ka noeng moenih. Ka rho he ka porhak sak ve. Namah ham na tlan mako. Ka tlannah neh tlan ham ka noeng moenih,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hlamat vaengah tah Israel khuikah tlannah ham neh hnothung ham ol khat khat neh ana khueng thiluh. Te vaengah hlang pakhat loh a khokhom a dul tih a hui taengla a paek te Israel khuikah ciphuemyuhnah coeng ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te dongah aka tlan tueng loh Boaz taengah, “Namah ham lai laeh,” a ti nah tih a khokhom te a dul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te dongah a hamca rhoek taeng neh pilnam boeih taengah Boaz loh , “Elimelekh kah a koe boeih khaw, Kilion neh Mahlon koe boeih khaw Naomi kut lamkah ka lai coeng tila tihnin ah laipai la na om uh coeng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te dongah amah koe neh aka duek ming thoh pah ham ni Mahlon yurho, Moab nu Ruth khaw ka yuu la ka lai coeng. Te phoeiah aka duek kah a ming te a pacaboeina khui lamkah neh te hmuen vongka lamloh a muei pawt ham khaw tihnin ah laipai la na om uh coeng,” a ti nah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Te vaengah vongka kah pilnam boeih neh a hamca rhoek loh, “Laipai la ka om uh coeng. Na im khuila aka kun huta tah, BOEIPA loh Israel imkhui aka thoh rhoi Rakhel neh Leah bangla khueh saeh. Epharath ah thadueng la om saeh lamtah Bethlehem ah a ming om saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hekah hula dongah BOEIPA loh nang m'paek na tii na ngan lamloh na imkhui khaw Tamar loh Judah ham a sak Perez imkhui bangla om saeh,” a ti nauh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Boaz loh Ruth te a loh tih a yuu la coeng. Ruth taengla a kun vaengah rhumpum ham khaw BOEIPA loh a paek coeng dongah capa a cun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te vaengah Naomi te huta rhoek loh, “Tihnin ah nang aka tlan ham te aka pat sak pawh BOEIPA te a yoethen pai saeh. A ming khaw Israel lakli ah thang pai saeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hamla na hinglu aka hlawt tih na sampok vaengah aka cangbam la om ni. Na langa loh nang n'lungnah tih anih a sak coeng. Anih pakhat he nang ham tah ca tongpa parhih lakah khaw then coeng,” a ti nauh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Camoe te Naomi loh a loh tih a rhang dongah a poem. Te dongah anih te camoe aka poeh la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Imben rhoek long khaw, “Naomi ham ca tongpa om coeng,” a ti uh camoe te a ming a sak pauh. Te dongah a ming te Obed a sak pauh. Anih tah Jesse napa tih, Jesse tah David napa la om.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Te dongah Perez a rhuirhong rhoek la Perez loh Khetsron a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khetsron loh Ram a sak tih Ram loh Amminadab a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amminadab loh Nahshon a sak tih Nahshon loh Salmon a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Salmon loh Boaz a sak tih Boaz loh Obed a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Obed loh Jesse a sak tih Jesse loh David a sak.
  </para>
</usx>
